  ("22-30","CHANG","You don't need a reason. 'I was thinking about you.' That's the whole call.","'I was thinking about you.'","same | Chang on the phone, smiling | CU"),
  ("30-37","SUN","Feeling alone most days? Tell your doctor. That counts as health, too.","Alone most days? Tell your doctor.","same | she pats his hand | CU"),
